# Python Linters (Ruff, Black)

- **Ruff**: Line length 88, target Python 3.14. Enable rules E, F, I, N, W. Run `uv run ruff check .` and `uv run ruff format .` before committing.
- **Black**: Line length 88, target py314. Keep formatting consistent with Black; Ruff format can be used as the formatter.
- Break lines over 88 characters; use parentheses for multi-line expressions. Fix import order (I001); Ruff --fix can auto-sort.
- No unused imports (F401) or variables. Prefer explicit exception handling; avoid bare `except:`.
